This core reproduces the CHGame handheld in an FPGA and contains or builds on the work of
others, listed here.

CHGame
  The handheld this core reproduces (WCH CH32X035, 128x128 ST7735, piezo, microSD).
  By Kevin Bates, https://github.com/bateske/CHGame, Apache License 2.0.
  No CHGame source is copied into this project, except the bootloader below.

